.It Sy s_client
This implements a generic SSL/TLS client which can establish a
transparent connection to a remote server speaking SSL/TLS. It's
intended for testing purposes only and provides only rudimentary
interface functionality but internally uses mostly all functionality of
the OpenSSL
.Sy ssl
library.
.It Sy s_server
This implements a generic SSL/TLS server which accepts connections from
remote clients speaking SSL/TLS. It's intended for testing purposes only
and provides only rudimentary interface functionality but internally
uses mostly all functionality of the OpenSSL
.Sy ssl
library.
It provides both an own command line oriented protocol for testing SSL
functions and a simple HTTP response facility to emulate an
SSL/TLS-aware webserver.
