.Xr openssl-env 7 .
.Pp
For information about the use of environment variables in configuration,
see
.Xr config 5 .
.Pp
For information about specific commands, see
.Xr openssl-engine 1 ,
.Xr openssl-rehash 1 ,
and
.Xr tsget 1 .
.Pp
For information about querying or specifying CPU architecture flags, see
.Xr OPENSSL_ia32cap 3 ,
.Xr OPENSSL_s390xcap 3
and
.Xr OPENSSL_riscvcap 3 .
