.Sh HISTORY
The
.Sy list
.Pf - Em XXX Ns Sy -algorithms
options were added in OpenSSL 1.0.0; For notes on the availability of
other commands, see their individual manual pages.
.Pp
The
.Sy -issuer_checks
option is deprecated as of OpenSSL 1.1.0 and is silently ignored.
.Pp
The
.Sy -xcertform
and
.Sy -xkeyform
options are obsolete since OpenSSL 3.0 and have no effect.
.Pp
The interactive mode, which could be invoked by running
.Qo Li openssl Qc
with no further arguments, was removed in OpenSSL 3.0, and running that
program with no arguments is now equivalent to
.Qo Li openssl help Qc .
